00:29:45.344 --> 00:29:46.865
Hadap kanan.

00:29:51.246 --> 00:29:53.688
Sekarang hadap kiri.

00:29:59.127 --> 00:30:00.637
Dan hadap ke tengah.

00:30:04.485 --> 00:30:06.565
Apa ada yang kamu kenal?

